Data
----
All competition, result and statistics data is retrieved at runtime from the
public Cubing China API:

    https://api.cubing.com
    https://wca-api.cubing.com

This project stores no data of its own and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Cubing China or the World Cube Association. Data is provided by the
respective services under their own terms.
